eral and administrative expenses for three and six months ended June 30, 2026, decreased to $307,261 and $673,619, respectively, compared to $341,199 and $753,261, respectively, for the three and six months ended June 30, 2025 primarily due to no payroll related bonus costs incurred in 2026."}],"nonop":[{"heading":"Other Income","text":"Other Income for the three and six months ended June 30, 2026, increased to $98,400, compared to $0 for the three and six months ended June 30, 2025, due to one-off credits against supplier invoices that were deemed no longer due and payable."}],"net":[{"heading":null,"text":"During the six months ended June 30, 2026 and 2025, net cash used in operating activities was primarily the result of net losses, partially offset by prepaid expenses, and accrued expenses."}],"ocf":[{"heading":"Operating Activities","text":"During the six months ended June 30, 2026 and 2025, net cash used in operating activities was primarily the result of net losses, partially offset by prepaid expenses, and accrued expenses."}],"capex":[{"heading":null,"text":"We have no other off-balance sheet arrangements that have had, or are reasonably likely to have, a material current or future effect on our consolidated financial statements or changes in financial condition, revenues or expenses, results of operations, liquidity, capital expenditures or capital resources."}]},"capex_src":null,"src":{"revenue":{"c":"us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerExcludingAssessedTax","l":"Revenue from Contract with Customer, Excluding Assessed Tax","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"rd":{"c":"us-gaap:ResearchAndDevelopmentExpense","l":"Research and development expenses","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"ga":{"c":"us-gaap:GeneralAndAdministrativeExpense","l":"General and administrative expenses","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"opex_total":{"c":"us-gaap:OperatingExpenses","l":"Operating Expenses","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"oi":{"c":"us-gaap:OperatingIncomeLoss","l":"Operating Income (Loss)","ytd":fa